3.3  Headers in row 3 (fill 1F7A3F, white bold text, centred):
       B3 Code      C3 Meaning      D3 Counts as      E3 Shift
3.4  Type the code table. "(blank)" means leave the cell empty.
       Row  B (Code)  C (Meaning)                     D (Counts as)  E (Shift)
       4    RT_1      Regular Time Present            Present        (blank)
       5    RT_0      Regular Time Absent             Leave          (blank)
       6    RT_EM     Regular Time Early Morning      Present        Early Morning
