       9    WO        Week Off                        Week Off       (blank)
     Rows 10 to 15 stay empty - they are 6 spare slots for future codes.
     IMPORTANT: column D words must be one of  Present / Leave / Holiday /
     Week Off / Other  and column E one of  Early Morning / Late Evening  (or
     blank). Part 8 adds dropdowns so you can't misspell them.
3.5  Slot colours - fill each Code cell (B4:B15) with its slot colour. On the
     month tabs a code is coloured with the colour of the row it sits in here:
       B4  B4C6E7    B5  F6D08B    B6  B3E0D6    B7  D4C5F0
