############################################################################
PART 7 - HELPER SHEET
############################################################################
Builds clean lists (no duplicates, no blanks) for the dropdowns.
You hide this sheet at the end (Part 13).

7.1  (Optional) labels in row 4 so you know what each column is:
       B4 team idx   C4 Teams   D4 sub idx   E4 Sub Teams   F4 dash sub idx
       G4 Sub Teams (dashboard)   I4 Months   J4 Month names   K4 Status
       L4 Counts as   M4 Shift   N4 Filter   O4 Criteria   Q4 code idx   R4 Codes
7.2  Row 5 starting values - type:
       B5 0    C5 All    D5 0    F5 0    G5 All    I5 All    Q5 0
7.3  Row 6 formulas. Enter all six, then select B6:G105 and press Ctrl+D (fills
     down to row 105 - one row per Setup row):
B6 - marks the first time each team appears in Setup
=IF(Setup!B6="","",IF(COUNTIF(Setup!$B$6:B6,Setup!B6)=1,MAX(B$5:B5)+1,""))
C6 - list of unique teams
=IFERROR(INDEX(Setup!$B$6:$B$105,MATCH(ROWS(C$6:C6),$B$6:$B$105,0)),"")
D6 - marks the first time each sub team appears
=IF(Setup!C6="","",IF(COUNTIF(Setup!$C$6:C6,Setup!C6)=1,MAX(D$5:D5)+1,""))
E6 - list of unique sub teams (Employee Master dropdown)
=IFERROR(INDEX(Setup!$C$6:$C$105,MATCH(ROWS(E$6:E6),$D$6:$D$105,0)),"")
F6 - marks the sub teams of the team chosen on the Dashboard
=IF(Setup!C6="","",IF(IF(TeamSel="All",COUNTIF(Setup!$C$6:C6,Setup!C6)=1,AND(Setup!B6=TeamSel,COUNTIFS(Setup!$B$6:B6,Setup!B6,Setup!$C$6:C6,Setup!C6)=1)),MAX(F$5:F5)+1,""))
G6 - list of those sub teams (Dashboard Sub Team dropdown)
=IFERROR(INDEX(Setup!$C$6:$C$105,MATCH(ROWS(G$6:G6),$F$6:$F$105,0)),"")
7.4  Fixed lists - type one value per cell:
       I6 to I17:  Jan Feb Mar Apr May Jun Jul Aug Sep Oct Nov Dec
       J6 to J17:  January February March April May June July August September
                   October November December
       K6 Active        K7 Inactive
       L6 Present       L7 Leave     L8 Holiday     L9 Week Off     L10 Other
       M6 Early Morning             M7 Late Evening
       N6 TeamCrit      N7 SubCrit   (labels only)
7.5  Filter criteria used by the Dashboard totals:
O6
=IF(TeamSel="All","<>#All#","="&TeamSel)
O7
=IF(SubSel="All","<>#All#","="&SubSel)
     ("<>#All#" simply means "match every row" when the filter is All.)
7.6  Code list without blanks. Enter both, then select Q6:R17 and press Ctrl+D:
Q6
=IF(Codes!B4="","",MAX(Q$5:Q5)+1)
R6
=IFERROR(INDEX(Codes!$B$4:$B$15,MATCH(ROWS(R$6:R6),$Q$6:$Q$17,0)),"")
7.7  Check: C6 shows your first team, E6 your first sub team, R6:R11 the six
     codes, G5 "All" followed by sub teams. Empty-looking cells are fine.


