9.10 Colour rules (conditional formatting) - this is what colours the codes
     To add ONE rule:
       a) Select the range given, starting at its FIRST (top-left) cell so that
          cell is the active one: e.g. click G10, then Shift+click AK209 - or
          type the range in the Name Box.
