############################################################################
APPENDIX B - TROUBLESHOOTING
############################################################################

#NAME? in a cell
  A named range is missing or misspelled. Formulas > Name Manager: compare with
  Part 2 (41 names).
The day-cell dropdown is empty
  Check Codes B4:B9, the Helper columns Q and R (Part 7.6) and the name CodeList.
A month shows "No tab yet" on the Dashboard
  The tab name is not exactly Mon-YYYY (e.g. "Jan-2026", no spaces) or the
  Dashboard Year is different.
The Check column shows "Check B2/B3"
  That tab's B2 (year) or B3 (month number) doesn't match its name.
Team / Sub Team dropdown on the Dashboard is empty
  Setup pairs are missing, or the Helper formulas were not filled down to row 105.
Numbers don't change when you pick a Team
  The team spelling in the Master must match Setup exactly (orange cells in the
  Master point to mismatches).
A formula shows as text instead of a result
  The cell was formatted as Text. Set it to General, click the cell, press F2,
  then Enter.
Codes are not coloured
  Check the names code_1 ... code_12 and the rule order in Part 9.10.
Error when pasting a formula
  Make sure the whole line was copied (Notepad: Format > Word Wrap OFF) and that
  your Excel uses commas as the list separator (see Part 0).

